---
// Shown to non-leads on /team: sets expectations that the tool is still being built.
---
<aside class="wip" aria-label="About this workspace">
  <p class="wip__title">Work in progress</p>
  <p class="wip__body">
    This is the live project workspace for The Space Between. It's still being built, and the
    schedule and roster are updated live as plans firm up, so what you see here is always the
    latest. Spot something wrong or missing? Tell Chris or Dan.
  </p>
</aside>

<style>
  .wip {
    background: var(--ink-soft);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--ember);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: var(--space-3) var(--space-4);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-6);
  }
  .wip__title {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: var(--ember);
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }
  .wip__body {
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    color: var(--paper);
    line-height: 1.5;
    max-width: 65ch;
  }
</style>
